title: 竞技场咏唱运行时API

本条目描述咏唱运行时提供给玩家的 TypeScript API 草案。

技能没有直接代码级 API。玩家编写的咏唱程序通过 DI 容器接入这些 API，生成签名链，平台根据签名链匹配魔法书配方自动触发技能。

!! 核心接口

```ts
export interface ChantProgram<TParams> {
  configure(container: ChantContainer): void;
  run(params: TParams, context: ChantContext): Promise<ChantProof>;
}

export interface ChantContainer {
  provide<T>(token: Token<T>, factory: (ctx: ChantContext) => T): void;
  get<T>(token: Token<T>): T;
}

export interface ChantContext {
  codex: ChantCodex;
  clock: ChantClock;
  repository: ChantRepository;
  logger: ChantLogger;
  rules: ChantRuleSet;
  equipment: EquippedArtifact[];
  events: ChantEventRuntime;
  recipe: ChantRecipeRuntime;
}
```

!! 咏唱 API 文档

平台长期稳定提供以下 API 族：

```ts
export interface ChantCodex {
  archive: ArchiveApi;
  hexstone: HexstoneApi;
  prayer: PrayerApi;
  index: IndexApi;
  lattice: LatticeApi;
  artifact: ArtifactApi;
  seal: SealApi;
  areaPower: AreaPowerApi;
}
```

每族 API 返回 opaque 中间对象，不能伪造：

```ts
type PageFragment = Opaque<'PageFragment'>;
type FacetShard = Opaque<'FacetShard'>;
type MeterKey = Opaque<'MeterKey'>;
type BoundVerse = Opaque<'BoundVerse'>;
type ChantProof = Opaque<'ChantProof'>;
```

!! 咏唱程序入口

```ts
export class BlinkStrikeChant implements ChantProgram<BlinkStrikeParams> {
  configure(container: ChantContainer): void {
    container.provide(TOKENS.routeStrategy, ctx =>
      new DistanceRouteStrategy(ctx.rules));
    container.provide(TOKENS.verseSource, ctx =>
      new ArchiveVerseAdapter(ctx.codex.archive));
    container.provide(TOKENS.pulseCollector, ctx =>
      new MeterPulseCollector(ctx.clock));
    container.provide(TOKENS.pipeline, ctx =>
      new ChantPipelineFactory(ctx.codex, ctx.rules).create('mobility'));
  }

  async run(params: BlinkStrikeParams, context: ChantContext): Promise<ChantProof> {
    const strategy = context.container.get(TOKENS.routeStrategy);
    const source = context.container.get(TOKENS.verseSource);
    const collector = context.container.get(TOKENS.pulseCollector);
    const pipeline = context.container.get(TOKENS.pipeline);

    collector.subscribe();

    const route = strategy.choose(params);
    const fragment = await source.nextVerse(route.seed);
    const pulse = await collector.waitFor(route.requiredPulseFamily);
    const bound = await pipeline.run({ fragment, pulse, params });

    return context.codex.seal.finalize({
      route,
      eventKeys: [pulse],
      pipelineTrace: bound.trace,
    });
  }
}
```

!! 与旧 API 的区别

| 旧机制 | 新机制 |
| --- | --- |
| `combatRuntime.createIntent()` | 无。玩家不直接创建意图 |
| `combatRuntime.cast(result)` | 无。平台自动根据签名链匹配配方触发技能 |
| `CombatResult` 手动构造 | `ChantProof` 由平台 API 生成，不可伪造 |
| 技能效果由代码决定 | 技能效果由魔法书配方和签名链匹配决定 |
| 能量池直接扣除 | 能量来源通过咏唱 API 调用自然消耗 |

